  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "ESG永續報告書評審實務",
    "sub_ename": "ESG REPORT AND PRACTICE\r",
    "describe_ch": "本課程由財團法人台灣永續能源研究基金會及商學院教師共同授課，以因應台灣企業永續獎維持評選活動客觀、公平、公正、嚴謹之需求，本課程希冀培育學生能有撰寫永續報告書之能力，通過試評測驗，可取得「台灣企業永續學院」發給見習評審員聘書，參與「台灣企業永續獎」評審。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is jointly taught by the Taiwan Institute for Sustainable Energy (TAISE) and Feng Chia University College of Business to meet the needs of the Taiwan Enterprise Sustainability Awards to maintain an objective, fair, just, and rigorous selection activities. This course hopes to train students to write sustainable reports, The ability to write books, and obtain a reviewer certificate to become permanent reviewers.",
