  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CB35522",
    "sub_id": "01063",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1.上課請準時出席，勿遲到早退或缺曠課。若有個人因素須請假，請依學校程序完成事假、病假或公假等請假手續。\n2.為尊重智慧財產權，請自行購買或借閱正版教科書，勿影印教科書。",
    "course_pol_en": "1.Based on classroom participation, attendance, discussion, homework and assignment grades, each teacher's evaluation accounts for 10%. The total score from six teachers accounts for 60%. Students will learn how to evaluate sustainability reports.\n2.The final project report accounts for 40%.Students will be divided into groups and complete a case analysis in both written and oral report formats.",
    "course_rem": "1.為增加課程理解專業能力，可事先預習，或按時課後複習。\n2.請準時出席課程，遲到或早退紀錄將計入課堂參與評分依據。\n3.缺曠過多者會影響學期成績，請同學留意。",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>報告內容請依學術論文格式引註參考資料，勿抄襲或翻譯他人文章或陳述。</div>\n\n<div>課堂作業、測驗或報告請自行完成，勿參考或抄襲他人答案或作品，尊重他人智慧成果。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>Please cite references in academic paper format for the content of your report.</div>\n\n<div>Avoid plagiarism or directly translating others&#39; articles or statements.</div>\n\n<div>Complete your assignments, quizzes, or reports independently without referring to or copying others&#39; answers or work.</div>\n\n<div>Respect the intellectual contributions of others.</div>\n\n<div>Please do not&nbsp;copy the&nbsp;handout and materials which tearchers offered&nbsp;directly as the reports.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
